description:
Design a 32-bit wide register that stores input data (din) on the rising edge of the clock (clk) when enable (en) is high. If the reset (rst) signal is asserted, the output (dout) is set to zero. This module functions as a synchronous storage element, updating its output with the input data only during enabled clock cycles while maintaining a reset functionality.
module top_module(input [32-1:0] din, 
                                   input clk, en, rst,
                                   output reg [32-1:0] dout
    );

code:
module top_module(input [32-1:0] din, 
                                   input clk, en, rst,
                                   output reg [32-1:0] dout
    );always @(posedge clk)
begin
  if(rst)
  dout <= 0;

  else
  if(en)
    dout <= din;

end 


endmodule

